      "benefits": "Proposed recovery, skin-remodeling and anti-inflammatory rationale: KLOW combines BPC-157, TB-500, GHK-Cu and KPV. Individual-component experiments report BPC-157 wound repair in rats, GHK-Cu connective-tissue effects in rat wounds, and KPV reduction of experimental intestinal inflammation in mice and cultured cells. These component findings do not demonstrate benefits of the four-part blend, its ratio, or synergy. No direct combination-efficacy study was found."
